#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Zobrazujú sa uložené modely pre:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Je zaregistrovaný iba jeden model tváre. Osvetlenie mení vzhľad vašej tváre "
"pred kamerou, takže jeden model môže večer pod lampami (alebo pri dennom "
"svetle) zlyhať. Pridajte druhý model zaznamenaný v inom svetle, aby bolo "
"odomykanie spoľahlivé kedykoľvek počas dňa."

#: src/main.ui:144
